35,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The eastern avenue planting is a cautionary tale. Half the trees died because aftercare was ignored.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Benjamin, that aligns with my findings. The clay subsoil here is a major risk for deep work.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Mio,,"I found that the habitat fund only pays for planting and water, not hard surfaces.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The groundskeeping roll is down to seven. We are relying on volunteers for the heavy lifting.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minako,,"My data shows people want firm ground to cross, and the heat is a serious issue.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"So, if we plant, we must budget for the watering, or it is a waste of money.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Misaki,,The depot notes say we can only hoard the south. The center must stay open.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, that is terrifying. If the staff is gone, who pays for the triple upkeep cost?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"The volunteer groups are active, but they are not a professional maintenance crew.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minako,,The drainage callouts have doubled. We cannot ignore the water management aspect.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The earlier basin survived, but the apron failed. Water management is more durable than paving.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Misaki,,I am leaning towards a plan that minimizes deep excavation. The clay is too risky.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Mio,,I am worried about the long-term cost of water features if the staff cannot maintain them.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Asuka,,I need a plan that the existing volunteer groups can actually support without burning out.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minako,,"The heat readings suggest we need shade, but the drainage suggests we need water retention.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
