60,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Option C, Wetland Restoration, seems to align with the durable water management we saw in the basin.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Benjamin, I agree. It avoids the deep excavation risks I found in the clay subsoil.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Mio,,But the upkeep ledger says water-managed ground costs triple. Can we afford that?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Asuka,,The volunteer group upriver already does habitat tasks. They could support the reed beds.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Minako,,The drainage data supports C. It addresses the doubled callouts and the heat issue.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,The habitat fund covers planting and water. C fits the funding terms perfectly.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"The phasing notes say the center cannot be hoarded, but C is mostly water and reeds.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Mio,,"I am still worried about the cost, but the funding terms might offset the capital.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"If the volunteers can handle the basic maintenance, the professional cost might be manageable.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Minako,,"The boardwalks provide the firm ground people want, while the water manages the heat.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,I am voting for C. It is the only one that respects the site's history and constraints.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I am also voting for C. It is the safest option for the ground conditions.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Mio,,"I will vote for C, hoping the funding covers the long-term costs.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I am voting for C. The volunteer support is a strong plus for sustainability.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Minako,,I am voting for C. It solves the drainage and heat problems directly.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
